<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - U.S. Filter started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - U.S. Filter started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch said Monday it had started coverage of United States Filter Corp with ratings of intermediate-term neutral and long-term buy.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the Palm Desert, Calif., wastewater treatment equipment and services company opened up 5/8 at 29-1/2.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
